WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
<b></b>

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:08.130
<b>Oh, thank goodness!</b>

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:10.960
<b>You've finally woken up, Manta!</b>

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:14.970
<b>What are you doing, Faust?</b>

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:17.600
<b>You had some weird plans, no doubt!</b>

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:20.850
<b>Whatever do you mean?</b>

00:00:20.930 --> 00:00:22.980
<b>You had fainted,</b>

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:24.730
<b>so I was taking you back.</b>

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:26.900
<b>I fainted?</b>

00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:31.110
<b>It seems it was a dreadful contest.</b>

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.200
<b><i>All three of Niles' members were slain,</i></b>

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:36.660
<b><i>with X-I securing victory.</i></b>

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:38.870
<b>Yeah…</b>

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:42.750
<b>Yoh and the others went to eat
to keep their strength up</b>

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:44.870
<b>because the final match</b>

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:47.130
<b>of the Shaman Fight's opening day</b>

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:49.900
<i>FUNBARI HOT SPRINGS</i>

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:49.840
<b><i>features us, apparently.</i></b>

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:52.630
<b>What? Is that true, Faust?</b>

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:56.130
<b>Why are you so panicked?</b>

00:00:57.340 --> 00:01:01.010
<b>Because I didn't know…</b>

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:04.850
<b>I didn't know the Shaman Fight
would be this scary!</b>

00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:08.270
<b>Manta.</b>

00:01:08.350 --> 00:01:10.440
<b>You do nothing but worry about everyone!</b>

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:12.940
<b>You're damn right I do! The guys are…</b>

00:01:13.030 --> 00:01:15.400
<b>So why not trust them?</b>

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:19.320
<b>If your friends are dear to you,</b>

00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:22.290
<b>the best way you can help them
in the Shaman Fight</b>

00:01:22.370 --> 00:01:23.950
<b>is by having faith in them.</b>

00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:26.000
<b>Don't worry.</b>

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:28.080
<b>We won't lose.</b>

