00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:03.220
KING'S CORN

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:08.330
<b>Ep.22</b>

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:08.330
<b>Ep.22</b>

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:08.330
<b>I'll Go Anywhere with You</b>

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:08.330
<b>I'll Go Anywhere with You</b>

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:08.850
<b>Hey, asshole!
Did you just give me the stink eye?</b>

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:10.640
<b>Stop it, Ryu!</b>

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:14.230
<b>Honestly! You're a real piece of work.</b>

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:16.770
<b>Just because you've got pre-game nerves,</b>

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:19.030
<b>you can't take it out on everyone you see!</b>

00:03:20.740 --> 00:03:22.990
<b>Cut him some slack, Anna.</b>

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:26.700
<b>That's probably just how Ryu
relaxes and warms up.</b>

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:29.450
<b>Speaking of which, you're far too relaxed!</b>

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:31.460
<b>Honestly! What's wrong with everyone?</b>

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:34.830
<b>It's always the same with you two.</b>

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:36.880
<b>I'm sick to death of it.</b>

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:39.760
<b>Hey! Did you come to cheer us on?</b>

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:42.970
<b>Idiot. We just came here to eat.</b>

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:46.720
<b>I can't believe the Patch Tribe
turned this school into a cafeteria.</b>

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:48.850
<b>That's some real dedication.</b>

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:53.480
<b>Anyway, do you really think
now is the time to slurp on noodles?</b>

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:56.810
<b>Yeah! They can get brought back up
out of your nose in your match</b>

00:03:56.900 --> 00:03:58.730
<b>and you'll be a laughingstock!</b>

00:03:58.820 --> 00:04:03.660
<b>Well, I wasn't really planning
on moving around all that much…</b>

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:06.620
<b>We'll probably win with one blow.</b>

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:12.210
<b>What the hell are you trying to say?</b>

00:04:13.460 --> 00:04:16.250
<b>Excuse me, everyone's staring at us,</b>

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:17.960
<b>so I think it might be best</b>

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:20.300
<b>not to say such provocative things…</b>

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:26.510
<b>Anna taught us the secrets
of the <i>Ultra Senji Ryakketsu.</i></b>

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:29.720
<b>We practiced its techniques
and became very strong.</b>

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:31.520
<b>That's all I mean.</b>

00:04:32.310 --> 00:04:34.690
<b>Now we'd better get going, Ryu.</b>

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:37.230
<b>You got it!</b>

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:40.480
<b>Do you understand now, Manta?</b>

00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:42.150
<b>At long last,</b>

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:43.900
<b>the time has come</b>

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:47.870
<b>for us to demonstrate the power of
the <i>Ultra Senji Ryakketsu</i> and our faith.</b>

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:53.540
<b><i>Go get them! Team Funbari Hot Springs!</i></b>

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:56.920
<b>Hey!</b>

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:01.800
<b>What is this nonsense?</b>

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:07.090
<b>Someone who had trouble
in his final prelim match</b>

00:05:07.180 --> 00:05:10.720
<b>could never get that strong
in just two months.</b>

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:14.640
<b>What matters is your natural instincts!
Your environment! Your work ethic!</b>

00:05:16.140 --> 00:05:18.190
<b>If we don't finish this in one hit,</b>

00:05:18.270 --> 00:05:20.320
<b>our pride will never recover!</b>

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:21.690
<b>Hold up.</b>

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:25.280
<b>Sorry, but would you leave us alone?</b>

00:05:26.030 --> 00:05:28.820
<b>I understand why
you're pissed off, though.</b>

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:30.910
<b>I get it!</b>

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:34.870
<b>You're their opponents, the Icemen!</b>

00:05:36.370 --> 00:05:39.040
<b>Aren't you the team who just fought?</b>

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:41.000
<b>They're your pals, huh?</b>

00:05:41.590 --> 00:05:44.090
<b>No wonder your match was so lukewarm.</b>

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:47.720
<b>Hey, easy now!</b>

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:47.720
<b>What?</b>

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:50.010
<b>I thought you were trying
to calm things down!</b>

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:53.930
<b>The one who becomes the Shaman King</b>

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:56.680
<b>must be outstanding in all areas.</b>

00:05:56.770 --> 00:05:59.310
<b>You guys are all over the place!</b>

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:01.940
<b>And the way you fight
is a mess, to say the least.</b>

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:04.780
<b>Your jokes are cringeworthy!</b>

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:08.950
<b>Hey! You're picking a fight
with the guy trying to make peace?</b>

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:12.910
<b>All you're doing is getting in our way.</b>

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:17.410
<b>Over Soul, Vodyanoy.</b>

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:19.540
<b>I am a Russian Shaman,</b>

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:23.130
<b>a commander of Slavic legend's
forgotten higher spirits.</b>

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:25.420
<b>My name is Zria.
This drum is my intermediary.</b>

00:06:26.130 --> 00:06:28.670
<b>When Vodyanoy,
a water spirit, possesses it,</b>

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:30.970
<b>we can control
all the moisture in the air.</b>

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:34.930
<b>Joco!</b>

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:38.850
<b>Over Soul, Badbh.</b>

00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:41.150
<b>I'm a Shaman hailing from Ireland,</b>

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:44.020
<b>a druid of the now lost Ulster tradition.</b>

00:06:44.110 --> 00:06:44.940
<b>Pino's the name.</b>

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:47.440
<b><i>My intermediary is this mistletoe crook.</i></b>

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:48.820
<b><i>Badbh, my Spirit Ally,</i></b>

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:51.950
<b><i>is a goddess
who takes the form of the raven.</i></b>

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:55.700
<b>My party trick is magic
that removes all heat!</b>

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:57.160
<b>Hey!</b>

00:06:57.250 --> 00:07:00.330
<b>After you've messed with us once,
you never mess with us again.</b>

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:04.500
<b>Over Soul, Deht the Viking.</b>

00:07:05.130 --> 00:07:06.960
<b>I am a Shaman from Iceland,</b>

00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:10.720
<b>a Runemaster of the lost Edda mythology.</b>

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:11.930
<b>Cadimahide.</b>

00:07:12.010 --> 00:07:13.930
<b>My intermediary is this helmet.</b>

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:17.520
<b>Once my Spirit Ally,
Deht the Viking, takes hold of it,</b>

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:20.520
<b>he becomes my armor,
destroying everything in his path!</b>

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:23.150
<b>Hold it right there!</b>

00:07:25.480 --> 00:07:29.610
<b>Well, we've shown enough of what
we're capable of to you sightseers.</b>

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:31.990
<b>I'll let this one slide.</b>

00:07:32.910 --> 00:07:34.740
<b>So you can put it that away.</b>

00:07:34.820 --> 00:07:36.530
<b>We were just having a little fun.</b>

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:40.040
<b>Needless to say,
my two men weren't going all out.</b>

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:43.000
<b>And here's a word of warning.</b>

00:07:44.210 --> 00:07:45.590
<b>Don't take Yoh lightly.</b>

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:47.880
<b>Ren!</b>

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:50.970
<b>Oh, really?</b>

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:55.260
<b><i>Oh, man. I can't wait for the match!</i></b>

00:07:55.890 --> 00:07:57.560
<b>Why are you acting so carefree?</b>

00:07:57.640 --> 00:08:00.270
<b>If you don't get changed soon,
you'll be late!</b>

00:08:00.850 --> 00:08:01.680
<b>Okay!</b>

00:08:02.310 --> 00:08:05.610
<b>I'm going to go leave it
all in the ring, Grandpa!</b>

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:14.740
<b>You finally decided to show up, did you?</b>

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:17.780
<b>We're tired of waiting,
you bunch of big-mouths!</b>

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:19.490
<b>Who? Us?</b>

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:20.950
<b>Don't act dumb!</b>

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:23.210
<b>That get-up… You think this is a joke?</b>

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:26.040
<b>You look like
you've just gotten out of bed.</b>

00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:28.630
<b>Well, we'll wake you up
with one good shot!</b>

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:30.670
<b>What?</b>

00:08:31.590 --> 00:08:33.630
<b>They've already produced
their Spirit Allies.</b>

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:34.970
<b>They must be keen!</b>

00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:37.260
<b>Why are they so mad?</b>

00:08:37.350 --> 00:08:39.100
<b>Was it something I did?</b>

00:08:39.180 --> 00:08:41.310
<b>I saw everything.</b>

00:08:44.020 --> 00:08:46.520
<b>Who'd have thought
that would happen in the cafeteria?</b>

00:08:47.310 --> 00:08:50.980
<b>But that doesn't give those bastards
the right to mock my uniforms!</b>

00:08:51.070 --> 00:08:55.610
<b><i><i>It's the advert for Funbari Hot Springs
they're mocking, Anna…</i></i></b>

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:57.740
<b>Never mind the uniforms.</b>

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:00.280
<b>Those guys are dangerous!</b>

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:01.910
<b>No, you're weak.</b>

00:09:01.990 --> 00:09:03.450
<b>You're just a fool, that's all.</b>

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:07.210
<b>Don't, Horohoro!</b>

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:09.710
<b>If you mess with them, you're done for!</b>

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:13.170
<b>Even I can see that they
know what they're doing.</b>

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:17.180
<b>But there's one thing I don't understand.</b>

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:19.680
<b>The <i>Ultra Senji Ryakketsu.</i></b>

00:09:21.350 --> 00:09:24.310
<b>And what was inside
the package Yoh was holding?</b>

00:09:25.020 --> 00:09:27.020
<b>He seems unusually confident.</b>

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:30.020
<b>It can't just be something
that simply makes him stronger, right?</b>

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:31.900
<b>I'm not telling the enemy.</b>

00:09:33.690 --> 00:09:37.070
<b>It's something extremely precious
to the Asakuras.</b>

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:39.870
<b>You'll see its power soon enough.</b>

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:43.490
<b>But I can only share its true secrets</b>

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:47.250
<b>with warriors aiding our cause.</b>

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:52.130
<b>The cause Yoh is fighting for
is far greater than Funbari Hot Springs.</b>

00:09:52.210 --> 00:09:53.250
FUNBARI HOT SPRINGS

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:55.380
<b>Right, so that's what happened.</b>

00:09:56.380 --> 00:09:59.340
<b>That must have upset you.</b>

00:09:59.430 --> 00:10:01.300
<b>My bad, Icemen.</b>

00:10:01.890 --> 00:10:04.720
<b>Spare us the phony apology.</b>

00:10:04.810 --> 00:10:08.440
<b>Not when you leave your Spirit Ally
to keep an eye on us.</b>

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:11.060
<b>What is he, your spy?</b>

00:10:11.150 --> 00:10:13.070
<b>What did you say?</b>

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:14.070
<b>Leave it, Ryu.</b>

00:10:15.650 --> 00:10:18.700
<b>My Spirit Ally is Amidamaru, a samurai.</b>

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:22.740
<b>This is Harusame, my intermediary.</b>

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:25.490
<b>It's a beat-up old sword
that I've broken twice already.</b>

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:28.580
<b>He was watching you because, as a samurai,</b>

00:10:28.660 --> 00:10:30.880
<b>he wanted to protect me.</b>

00:10:31.500 --> 00:10:33.210
<b>There was no ill will there.</b>

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:37.170
<b>Besides, finding out all about you</b>

00:10:37.260 --> 00:10:38.880
<b>won't change anything we do.</b>

00:10:40.050 --> 00:10:41.050
<b>Because after all,</b>

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:43.720
<b>we'll probably win either way.</b>

00:10:45.560 --> 00:10:48.600
<b>I told you, you'll pay
for underestimating us!</b>

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:50.390
<b>Who do you think you are?</b>

00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:53.230
<b>You sure talk big</b>

00:10:53.310 --> 00:10:55.610
<b>for three people
who only have human spirits!</b>

00:10:56.440 --> 00:10:57.650
<b><i>Master Yoh…</i></b>

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:02.570
<b><i>So much has come to pass</i></b>

00:11:04.030 --> 00:11:05.120
<b><i>since you saved me.</i></b>

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:09.910
<b>I always wanted to live as a true samurai.</b>

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:12.460
<b>So the days spent being of service to you</b>

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:16.210
<b>have been my most fulfilling,
in life and death!</b>

00:11:17.670 --> 00:11:18.880
<b>Now is the time…</b>

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:24.010
<b>to repay my debt of gratitude!</b>

00:11:25.300 --> 00:11:26.430
<b>Amidamaru!</b>

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:28.430
<b>Would you care to test</b>

00:11:28.520 --> 00:11:32.020
<b>the complete body-and-soul devotion
of Amidamaru?</b>

00:11:33.350 --> 00:11:35.650
<b>Okay. Let's do this,</b>

00:11:35.730 --> 00:11:36.690
<b>Amidamaru!</b>

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:41.490
<b>Amidamaru in Harusame!</b>

00:11:42.070 --> 00:11:44.530
<b>In Futsu-no-Mitama Sword!</b>

00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:55.330
<b>Over Soul!</b>

00:11:56.210 --> 00:11:57.500
<b>Spirit of Sword!</b>

00:11:58.840 --> 00:11:59.670
<b>It's enormous!</b>

00:12:00.260 --> 00:12:05.760
<b>Over 600 years, Amidamaru has transformed
his soul into a higher spirit.</b>

00:12:06.760 --> 00:12:08.220
<b>No objections, right?</b>

00:12:09.430 --> 00:12:11.390
<b>Okay. Let's get started.</b>

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:27.030
<b>Amazing!</b>

00:12:27.990 --> 00:12:30.450
<b>So that's Yoh's new power!</b>

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:35.000
<b>He places Amidamaru, now a higher spirit,
inside Harusame using Over Soul.</b>

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:39.710
<b>Then he uses Over Soul to imbue
them both together into Futsu-no-Mitama.</b>

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:44.590
<b>Spirit of Sword
really is a fitting name for that.</b>

00:12:45.090 --> 00:12:46.430
<b>Lord Hao.</b>

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:49.850
<b>I don't know about
the Futsu-no-Mitama Sword.</b>

00:12:50.430 --> 00:12:52.430
<b>Well, basically,</b>

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:55.640
<b>it's a sword that belonged
to an ancient sword god.</b>

00:12:56.480 --> 00:12:59.440
<b><i>It's actually nothing more
than just a stone sword,</i></b>

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:02.230
<b><i>but the longer its history,
the stronger an intermediary is.</i></b>

00:13:02.320 --> 00:13:05.650
<b><i>I can't think of anything better
to use Over Soul with.</i></b>

00:13:06.240 --> 00:13:10.870
<b>That must have been what was inside
the package sent by the Asakuras.</b>

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:13.870
<b>I'm quite surprised, though.</b>

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:16.670
<b><i>That thing they've kept
stowed away in their cellar</i></b>

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:19.080
<b><i>would cause a real stir
if the public caught wind.</i></b>

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:20.840
<b><i>It's a national treasure.</i></b>

00:13:21.710 --> 00:13:24.220
<b><i>If they're going to these lengths,</i></b>

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:26.970
<b><i>they must really want to defeat me!</i></b>

00:13:28.800 --> 00:13:31.470
<b>But the real surprise is him.</b>

00:13:32.180 --> 00:13:36.480
<b>Mastering two-stage intermediaries
in such a short period is extraordinary.</b>

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:39.940
<b><i><i>Damn! What is going on?</i></i></b>

00:13:40.520 --> 00:13:42.730
<b><i><i>He has techniques I haven't even heard of!</i></i></b>

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:47.240
<b>Did he say Amidamaru
has evolved into a higher spirit?</b>

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:51.740
<b>Using all this Mana is really tiring.</b>

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:54.290
<b>Go back to normal for a minute, Amidamaru.</b>

00:13:55.200 --> 00:13:56.580
<b>He's going back?</b>

00:13:57.210 --> 00:13:58.330
<b>Of course.</b>

00:13:58.420 --> 00:14:01.840
<b>It's not like Amidamaru
has forgotten his old form.</b>

00:14:02.340 --> 00:14:04.260
<b>What does that mean?</b>

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:05.920
<b>Usually, higher spirits</b>

00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:10.590
<b>are formed when ordinary spirits
are trapped for centuries in this world</b>

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:12.390
<b>due to strong, unresolved feelings.</b>

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:16.140
<b>They forget their old form
and become clusters of emotion.</b>

00:14:16.230 --> 00:14:18.060
<b>Even you must know that much, right?</b>

00:14:18.690 --> 00:14:23.480
<b><i>So it wouldn't have been unusual if he
had become a higher spirit long ago.</i></b>

00:14:23.570 --> 00:14:25.650
<b><i>But he's insanely stubborn.</i></b>

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:30.660
<b>In other words, he's no different
to the old Amidamaru?</b>

00:14:33.030 --> 00:14:37.790
<b>The intensity of a higher spirit
is on a whole other level.</b>

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:42.290
<b>Amidamaru is now completely
a sword spirit!</b>

00:14:43.460 --> 00:14:44.670
<b>It's marvelous.</b>

00:14:47.970 --> 00:14:49.630
<b>Ren! Aren't you watching the match?</b>

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:52.470
<b>I've seen who will win.</b>

00:14:52.550 --> 00:14:54.260
<b>There's no need to see any more.</b>

00:14:54.350 --> 00:14:57.560
<b>You're so shocked by Yoh's strength,</b>

00:14:57.640 --> 00:14:58.930
<b>you're going to sulk in bed!</b>

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:00.140
<b>Like hell I am!</b>

00:15:01.150 --> 00:15:03.980
<b>If Yoh can beat them with one blow,</b>

00:15:04.060 --> 00:15:05.980
<b>I can beat them in one blink of an eye!</b>

00:15:07.110 --> 00:15:08.150
<b>What gives?</b>

00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:10.400
<b>What's there to be pissed about?</b>

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:13.240
<b><i><i>If he can get me worked up like this,</i></i></b>

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:15.910
<b><i><i>I really can't take him lightly.</i></i></b>

00:15:16.450 --> 00:15:20.580
<b><i><i>It seems it won't be long
until I'll be forced to use it.</i></i></b>

00:15:22.080 --> 00:15:23.080
<b>Hey!</b>

00:15:23.170 --> 00:15:25.540
<b>What do you mean, it's tiring?</b>

00:15:25.630 --> 00:15:27.090
<b>You really had me scared!</b>

00:15:27.840 --> 00:15:29.260
<b>Just a little bit!</b>

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:34.180
<b>Sorry! I just like taking it easy.</b>

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:36.970
<b>This is no laughing matter!</b>

00:15:37.060 --> 00:15:39.560
<b>Don't think you can get by
in life by taking it easy!</b>

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:41.190
<b>You're right.</b>

00:15:41.270 --> 00:15:44.770
<b>You can only truly take it easy
after putting in hard work.</b>

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:47.360
<b>That's why I'm here to fight.</b>

00:15:48.900 --> 00:15:51.320
<b>Now, shall we get down
to business, Icemen?</b>

00:15:52.150 --> 00:15:53.610
<b>Interesting!</b>

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:57.120
<b>But you'd better forget your
half-baked ideas, Funbari Hot Springs!</b>

00:15:57.660 --> 00:16:00.790
<b>We're not so kind
as to give you an easy death!</b>

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:03.620
<b>Match three of the first round!</b>

00:16:03.710 --> 00:16:06.840
<b>Team Funbari Hot Springs
versus the Icemen!</b>

00:16:12.170 --> 00:16:13.050
<b>I thought I told you.</b>

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:15.760
<b>We don't do lukewarm battles!</b>

00:16:15.840 --> 00:16:18.680
<b>We'll be taking out the easy prey first!</b>

00:16:21.350 --> 00:16:24.400
<b>They got him with a special team attack!</b>

00:16:21.350 --> 00:16:24.400
<b>Faust!</b>

00:16:25.440 --> 00:16:28.020
<b>So frail that he went flying, huh?
Now to finish him off!</b>

00:16:28.110 --> 00:16:29.440
<b>Not so fast.</b>

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:31.530
<b>Faust's only just about to get started.</b>

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:38.240
<b>He can stand?</b>

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:38.240
<b>He stood up!</b>

00:16:39.030 --> 00:16:40.200
<b>I sacrificed</b>

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:42.370
<b><i>my own legs</i></b>

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:46.540
<b><i>to treat Eliza's after she lost hers
in our fight against Yoh.</i></b>

00:16:48.210 --> 00:16:49.800
<b>But I managed to attain new legs</b>

00:16:49.880 --> 00:16:51.840
<b>by using someone else's.</b>

00:16:52.510 --> 00:16:54.050
<b>Be careful, Pino!</b>

00:16:54.130 --> 00:16:56.680
<b>He's hiding something in his legs!</b>

00:16:57.590 --> 00:17:00.100
<b>Please bear with me,
just for a short while,</b>

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:02.180
<b>Frankensteiny.</b>

00:17:03.430 --> 00:17:04.640
<b>Just until</b>

00:17:06.020 --> 00:17:08.060
<b>I finish my operation.</b>

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:09.610
<b>Bones?</b>

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:13.440
<b>Shall we go, Eliza?</b>

00:17:14.490 --> 00:17:15.820
<b>Faust,</b>

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:17.990
<b>I'll go anywhere with you.</b>

00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:19.870
<b><i><i>Hey!</i></i></b>

00:17:19.950 --> 00:17:21.410
<b><i><i>This guy's got a screw loose!</i></i></b>

00:17:21.490 --> 00:17:23.500
<b><i><i>What the hell is that Spirit Ally?</i></i></b>

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:26.580
<b><i><i>She just looks like some pushover nurse.</i></i></b>

00:17:26.670 --> 00:17:28.540
<b><i><i>And why are they all lovey-dovey?</i></i></b>

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:31.300
<b><i><i>Team Funbari Hot Springs…</i></i></b>

00:17:31.880 --> 00:17:33.840
<b><i><i>I just can't get a read on them!</i></i></b>

00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:35.920
<b>Serves you right.</b>

00:17:36.010 --> 00:17:38.840
<b>That's what you get for making fun
of my handmade uniforms.</b>

00:17:38.930 --> 00:17:41.100
<b>Check it out, Joco!</b>

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:44.890
<b>It even says "Funbari Hot Springs"
on Faust's clothes!</b>

00:17:44.980 --> 00:17:46.100
<b>So lame!</b>

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:47.060
<b>I know!</b>

00:17:48.900 --> 00:17:50.900
<b>That's weird. Something's off.</b>

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:52.270
<b>What?</b>

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:52.270
<b>What?</b>

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:54.570
<b><i>I thought that Faust</i></b>

00:17:54.650 --> 00:17:58.860
<b><i>became a Shaman so that he could be
reunited with his late wife, Eliza.</i></b>

00:17:58.950 --> 00:18:01.450
<b><i>But though Necromancy allowed him</i></b>

00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:05.160
<b><i>to manipulate the dead,
he couldn't bring her mind back to life.</i></b>

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:09.710
<b>But I'm sure I just saw Eliza talk…</b>

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:14.000
<b>Hey, you! Stop that weird rocking!</b>

00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:15.420
<b>Pardon me.</b>

00:18:16.300 --> 00:18:18.760
<b>I've had it with all of you
playing the fool!</b>

00:18:19.550 --> 00:18:20.760
<b>No more!</b>

00:18:21.640 --> 00:18:25.020
<b>This nutjob isn't worthy
of being our opponent!</b>

00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:27.020
<b>Come on, Icemen!</b>

00:18:27.100 --> 00:18:29.230
<b>Smash this idiot like an ice cube!</b>

00:18:30.810 --> 00:18:32.230
<b>Wow!</b>

00:18:30.810 --> 00:18:32.230
<b>Wow!</b>

00:18:32.310 --> 00:18:33.440
<b>Move, Faust!</b>

00:18:39.150 --> 00:18:40.100
<b>He jumped up high!</b>

00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:41.990
<b>That's a lot of water, though!</b>

00:18:42.070 --> 00:18:43.160
<b>Can he get away in time?</b>

00:18:43.740 --> 00:18:44.660
<b>Vodyanoy!</b>

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:49.160
<b>Deht! Viking Ship Mode!</b>

00:18:50.290 --> 00:18:52.040
<b>Now it's my turn!</b>

00:18:52.130 --> 00:18:55.210
<b>Let's see what you think
of our combination attack!</b>

00:18:55.920 --> 00:18:57.760
<b>Ice Launcher!</b>

00:18:59.220 --> 00:19:00.550
<b>Faust!</b>

00:19:04.050 --> 00:19:05.560
<b>Oh, dear.</b>

00:19:05.640 --> 00:19:07.600
<b>I thought it was a sudden rain shower,</b>

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:10.060
<b>but then it turned into snow.</b>

00:19:11.100 --> 00:19:12.400
<b>You're not hurt, are you?</b>

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:15.190
<b>What? I'm fine.</b>

00:19:15.270 --> 00:19:18.030
<b>The pain of seeing you harmed</b>

00:19:18.110 --> 00:19:20.490
<b>would sting far greater than this, Eliza.</b>

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:24.280
<b>What's with him?</b>

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:26.740
<b>Protecting his Spirit Ally like that…</b>

00:19:27.490 --> 00:19:29.120
<b>He really is mad!</b>

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:31.420
<b>A spirit can't be injured!</b>

00:19:33.580 --> 00:19:37.000
<b>He's the kind of guy who'll do anything
for what matters to him.</b>

00:19:37.630 --> 00:19:41.510
<b>He's only in this tournament
so he can see Eliza again.</b>

00:19:42.890 --> 00:19:45.430
<b>Anyway, he's a simple, straight-up guy.</b>

00:19:45.510 --> 00:19:46.760
<b>Don't worry about him.</b>

00:19:47.350 --> 00:19:48.640
<b>Oh, I won't.</b>

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:52.020
<b>More importantly,
my pride is wounded even more</b>

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:56.610
<b>to learn that our opponent
is fighting for such a dumb reason!</b>

00:19:57.190 --> 00:19:58.570
<b>Oh, really?</b>

00:19:59.820 --> 00:20:02.030
<b>What matters to people
is their own choice.</b>

00:20:02.610 --> 00:20:05.700
<b>As long as he's serious about it,
what difference does it make?</b>

00:20:06.370 --> 00:20:08.830
<b>And I'm telling you
that it's all half-baked crap!</b>

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:11.120
<b>You piss me off, kid.</b>

00:20:11.620 --> 00:20:13.210
<b>I think we'll leave the nutjob</b>

00:20:13.290 --> 00:20:15.330
<b>and smash you first instead!</b>

00:20:16.710 --> 00:20:17.840
<b>No.</b>

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:21.010
<b>You cannot lay a finger on Yoh.</b>

00:20:22.590 --> 00:20:25.090
<b>He is my savior.</b>

00:20:25.590 --> 00:20:26.850
<b>What?</b>

00:20:25.590 --> 00:20:26.850
<b>What?</b>

00:20:27.430 --> 00:20:31.180
<b>Besides, my dream came true long ago.</b>

00:20:32.520 --> 00:20:34.310
<b><i>It happened two months ago,</i></b>

00:20:34.390 --> 00:20:37.270
<b><i>thanks to Anna the Itako's
Spirit Channeling.</i></b>

00:20:38.190 --> 00:20:39.110
<b>What?</b>

00:20:38.190 --> 00:20:39.110
<b>What?</b>

00:20:39.900 --> 00:20:41.280
<b>However,</b>

00:20:41.360 --> 00:20:44.400
<b>it was also the moment
I lost the purpose of my life.</b>

00:20:46.370 --> 00:20:50.870
<b><i>I was desperate to be
by my Eliza's side once more.</i></b>

00:20:52.200 --> 00:20:55.370
<b><i>And the one who extended
a kind hand to me was him.</i></b>

00:20:56.210 --> 00:20:59.040
<b>I'm not really sure why,</b>

00:20:59.130 --> 00:21:02.340
<b>but apparently, you'd be
a great help to us at our place.</b>

00:21:03.170 --> 00:21:04.800
<b>What was it again?</b>

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:07.550
<b>We could use your medical skills
and your good looks?</b>

00:21:07.640 --> 00:21:10.100
<b>Would you be interested
in working at the inn?</b>

00:21:11.470 --> 00:21:13.230
<b>If you're interested,</b>

00:21:13.310 --> 00:21:14.890
<b>I could train you</b>

00:21:14.980 --> 00:21:17.480
<b>so that you can be with Eliza
whenever you want.</b>

00:21:18.730 --> 00:21:21.320
<b><i>And that's when I found it at last!</i></b>

00:21:22.190 --> 00:21:24.360
<b>My second life with Eliza</b>

00:21:24.440 --> 00:21:27.570
<b>at Funbari Hot Springs,
which will surely be completed one day!</b>

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:31.660
<b>So that's it. She exploited his weakness.</b>

00:21:32.290 --> 00:21:34.290
<b>I just filled a hole in his heart.</b>

00:21:34.370 --> 00:21:36.580
<b>It sounds a bit like a con.</b>

00:21:36.670 --> 00:21:38.130
<b>Poor man…</b>

00:21:40.040 --> 00:21:41.210
<b>Don't feel sorry for him!</b>

00:21:41.920 --> 00:21:44.550
<b>That's why you cannot touch Yoh.</b>

00:21:45.970 --> 00:21:49.720
<b>I must protect the proprietor
of Funbari Hot Springs.</b>

00:21:52.470 --> 00:21:54.980
<b>See if you think this is half-baked.</b>

00:21:55.560 --> 00:22:00.110
<b>Lifted to its very zenith
by the <i>Ultra Senji Ryakketsu</i>,</b>

00:22:00.190 --> 00:22:03.110
<b>tremble at the essence</b>

00:22:03.900 --> 00:22:06.030
<b>of my Necromancy!</b>

00:22:06.650 --> 00:22:09.160
<b>Behold the diabolic beauty of my bride!</b>

00:22:11.530 --> 00:22:12.990
<b>Over Soul!</b>

